        "/Desc": {
          "key": "ScoreBossAbility.100012.2",
          "zh_TW": "己方每對首領造成<color=#ec6d21>&Param7&</color>次技能傷害，首領受到絕招傷害強度增加<color=#ec6d21>&Param1&</color>，最高可疊加<color=#ec6d21>&Param2&</color>層，持續<color=#ec6d21>&Param3&</color>秒。\n己方每對首領造成<color=#ec6d21>&Param8&</color>次印記傷害，首領受到技能傷害強度增加<color=#ec6d21>&Param4&</color>，最高可疊加<color=#ec6d21>&Param5&</color>層，持續<color=#ec6d21>&Param6&</color>秒。",
          "zh_CN": "己方每对首领造成<color=#ec6d21>&Param7&</color>次技能伤害，首领受到绝招伤害强度增加<color=#ec6d21>&Param1&</color>，最多叠加<color=#ec6d21>&Param2&</color>层，持续<color=#ec6d21>&Param3&</color>秒。\n己方每对首领造成<color=#ec6d21>&Param8&</color>次印记伤害，首领受到技能伤害强度增加<color=#ec6d21>&Param4&</color>，最多叠加<color=#ec6d21>&Param5&</color>层，持续<color=#ec6d21>&Param6&</color>秒。",
